     A*
     A* - PCS Bill Transmission Information
     A*
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Created on 06/20/2001 by C:62 for Project:114MCI
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Purpose: This file will hold the member #, date/time uploaded,
     A*          date/time converted, and date/time processed of the
     A*          "batch" of bills received from PCS.
     A*****************************************************************
     A* REVISIONS
     A*
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(FSREFP)
     A          R PS901                     TEXT('PCS Bill Trans Info')
     A            S9NAME    R               REFFLD(DS10)
     A                                      COLHDG('Member name from INF')
     A            S9ULDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Upload Date')
     A*           Upload date when FAS9P record created
     A*
     A            S9ULTM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Upload Time')
     A            S9CVDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Convert Date')
     A*           Convert date when data converted from PAFINPT
     A*           member to FAS1P
     A*
     A            S9CVTM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Convert Time')
     A            S9PRDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Process Date')
     A*           Process date when all FAS1P records have a value
     A*           in S1PRFL for a given "batch".  This will prevent
     A*           the PAFINPT member from appearing on the "Upload
     A*           PCS Bills" screen, since all the FAS1P records
     A*           have been processed.  We don't want to process that
     A*           member again.
     A*
     A            S9PRTM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Process Time')
     A*
     A            S9STAT    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('Status')
     A            S9USER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint User')
     A            S9PGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint Program')
     A            S9TIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint Time')
     A            S9DT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Maint Date')
     A            S9IUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial User')
     A            S9IPGM    R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Program')
     A            S9ITIM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Time')
     A            S9IDT     R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Date')
